ind":"announcement","title":"Demo Updated with 2 New Levels!","summary":"Hello! Just dropping in to say that the demo has been updated! This update adds two more levels so you can experience more of the game mechanics before you buy the full game. This will most likely be the last time the game is updated before the final game release (excepting any large bugfixes) since the rest of the levels I am working on will be saved for the full release. Enjoy!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-20T21:17:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199310046","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4416830-1829528821309043","game_id":"steam-4416830","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo is now live!","summary":"Hello Battledrifters! The demo is now live! I'm so excited that y'all finally have a chance to try the game.On my end, I'm relieved to have reached a level of polish on the demo that I'm happy with and being able to shift my focus back towards making more content for the game. Making menus for the last few months (and rebuilding the player select screen for the 3rd time) was really starting to drain me. I'd love to hear your thoughts on the game in the comments below. Enjoy!-DragonDuckGames","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-10T04:31:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1829528821309043","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4416830":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:11:02Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:11:02Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4416830":"2026-10-26T12:11:02Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4416830":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-